  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.0.193\n\n## Changes (initial history)\n\n- docs: reconcile #130 and #103 closure across roadmap docs (#138) (`65d675f`)\n- feat: add VGM music input for GB and NES (`58c7d3a`)\n- fix: stabilize NES camera streaming (`dd58910`)\n- Fix runner free-scroll background streaming (`f5e7272`)\n- Fix tall runner background streaming (`bc8d3a8`)\n- Fix runner free-scroll background streaming (`7670c95`)\n- Add tall runner free-scroll map (`ede8ed8`)\n- Add wide actor Y support (`10cce70`)\n- Add runner dead-zone camera collision (`978272f`)\n- feat(samples): add dead-zone follow acceptance (`7e27099`)\n- feat(samples): add tiled free-scroll acceptance (`aad28ba`)\n- Enable NES Tiled vertical four-screen scroll (`8a8e4e6`)\n- feat(gameboy): add diagonal tiled scroll sample (`cd10654`)\n- Revert \"wip(runner): enlarge Tiled map canvas to 50x20 for free-scroll authoring\" (`24acb58`)\n- fix(tiled): round fractional actor spawn coordinates to nearest pixel (`5a737f2`)\n- feat(gameboy): stream tall tiled maps vertically (`add6614`)\n- wip(runner): enlarge Tiled map canvas to 50x20 for free-scroll authoring (`f894603`)\n- docs(camera): record when to escalate GB diagonal to Strategy B (`6ff221f`)\n- docs: add project overview (`aebaf21`)\n- docs: document staggered diagonal camera support (`de7ac23`)\n- feat(gb): stagger diagonal camera streaming (`5b88abd`)\n- fix(sdk): reject game boy diagonal camera requests (`22fb41a`)\n- docs(nes): document free-scroll streaming support (`f6a793c`)\n- feat(nes): complete four-screen free scroll streaming (`b446265`)\n- docs(nes): gate free-scroll streaming capabilities (`b7b0e31`)\n- feat(nes): add four-screen free scroll camera (`f99747a`)\n- docs(nes): add free 2-axis scroll roadmap (`684b42f`)\n- docs(camera): document diagonal scroll as recommended proof of concept (`4710526`)\n- feat(gb): validate vertical camera scroll (`a90a09e`)\n- feat: add animated runner Goomba actor (`7bedfdc`)\n- perf(actors): hoist camera-X projection per phase loop (`83ec07c`)\n- docs: close out AR-14 actor framework (AF-4.3) (`9bf9bf6`)\n- feat(actors): generated-name guards and codegen robustness (`f039845`)\n- feat(actors): metasprite-aware actor pool capability checks (`13bd16c`)\n- feat(actors): runtime camera-window actor activation (`d0a2d5b`)\n- feat(actors): per-actor camera-relative collision and contact (`52d8182`)\n- fix(codegen): make var-var compare/subtract reentrant under nesting (`740a18b`)\n- feat(actors): world-space actor positioning and camera-relative draw (`8761c09`)\n- docs: track actor framework review findings as Phase 5 (`72f1a02`)\n- feat(actors): scalable platformer actor framework over struct-array pools (`f222770`)\n- docs: add actor framework branch roadmap and task breakdown (`aa56296`)\n- feat(lang): byte-backed struct arrays with runtime-indexed field access (`cdc4ebd`)\n- fix: keep runner OAM writes in VBlank (`066aa17`)\n- docs: add scalable platformer actor roadmap (`4f2dc80`)\n- feat(gameboy): add transparent MBC1 banking foundation (`f710333`)\n- feat(gameboy): SDK-op stream foundation for transparent code banking (`2270ae5`)\n- fix(runner): B-run accelerates only with traction; fix backward scroll (`4f3f9b5`)\n- fix: make runner solid blocks block the player from below (`c01d437`)\n- fix: keep Game Boy music tempo locked to frames while scrolling (`b63b014`)\n- feat: transparent MBC1 banking for large and multiple Game Boy music (`7c9b4b8`)\n",
